      {
        "Id": "83fd33b6dbba4682a35976229206a503",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  pick the walls (all / selected / active view), set skirting + finish, Run\nSkirting = Revit wall sweep: follows every wall, stops at doors, schedulable.  INSIDE / OUTSIDE / partitions both faces.\nPOSITION: 1 ON the plaster (sticks out by its thickness)  2 FLUSH - front face in line with the plaster (wall cut behind)  3 on the block / core face.\nWall finish: WITH plaster (inside / outside thickness) or WITHOUT finish - new wall types '<type> (P12/18)' / '<type> (NO FINISH)'.\nRun again to change size or faces: old skirting on those walls is replaced, never duplicated.",
        "DescriptionText": null,
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
